WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.606
Welcome to Idea Pool, our EMBA group's home for startup ideas.

00:03.956 --> 00:08.901
Browse the feed, and tap plus to add your idea. A title and a one-line pitch are enough.

00:09.251 --> 00:14.280
Within two minutes, Claude searches the web for competitors, and scores your idea like an investor would.

00:14.630 --> 00:17.623
Like the ideas you love, and discuss them in the comments.

00:17.973 --> 00:23.737
On the Me tab, pick a fun avatar, and upload your LinkedIn PDF, so Claude can match you to the right ideas.

00:24.087 --> 00:28.765
Then vote on the shortlist, and in meeting mode, we pick the idea we pitch. Let's go!
